  "transcript": [
    {
      "start": 180,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Okay, let's get into it."
    },
    {
      "start": 192,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Most salons lose one appointment in eight to no-shows, and almost nobody tracks it."
    },
    {
      "start": 201,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "We looked at 2,400 booking pages last spring."
    },
    {
      "start": 208,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "The pages that asked for nothing up front had twice the no-show rate of the pages that took a card."
    },
    {
      "start": 219,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "And a card on file doesn't mean you have to charge it."
    },
    {
      "start": 226,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Ask for a card at booking, even if you never charge it."
    },
    {
      "start": 238,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Jordan, you went further than that, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 600,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "So here's what happened when we switched."
    },
    {
      "start": 605,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "I charged a $20 deposit and lost two clients."
    },
    {
      "start": 612,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "I also got back nine hours a month that I used to spend staring at an empty chair."
    },
    {
      "start": 623,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "Those two clients were the ones who no-showed four times a year anyway."
    },
    {
      "start": 634,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "My regulars didn't even blink, because they always show up."
    },
    {
      "start": 643,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "Charge the deposit."
    },
    {
      "start": 652,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "I love that."
    },
    {
      "start": 760,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "So the way we word it on the booking page matters."
    },
    {
      "start": 768,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "We don't call it a deposit, we call it holding your spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 776,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "It comes off the price of the visit, and we say that right next to the button."
    },
    {
      "start": 788,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "Clients read it as a reservation, not a penalty."
    },
    {
      "start": 797,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "That one line cut our payment disputes to zero."
    },
    {
      "start": 810,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Zero, wow."
    },
    {
      "start": 850,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "Like I said earlier, the policy is only half of it."
    },
    {
      "start": 857,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "The other half is how you enforce it on the day."
    },
    {
      "start": 866,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "If you waive it every time someone has a sad story, it's not a policy."
    },
    {
      "start": 885,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Fair point."
    },
    {
      "start": 1055,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "Here's a question I ask every clinic I talk to."
    },
    {
      "start": 1060,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "Why do people forget an appointment they booked yesterday?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1066,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "They don't forget the appointment, they forget the time."
    },
    {
      "start": 1074,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "Most reminders go out at nine in the morning, when they're at work and can't reply."
    },
    {
      "start": 1086,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "We moved ours to the hour of day the client originally booked."
    },
    {
      "start": 1097,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "Replies went up because they're holding their phone at that hour anyway."
    },
    {
      "start": 1106,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "Send the reminder at the time they booked, not at nine in the morning."
    },
    {
      "start": 1115,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "That's so simple."
    },
    {
      "start": 1185,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "Our reminder used to say you have an appointment tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "start": 1192,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "Nobody felt they were letting a person down."
    },
    {
      "start": 1201,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "Now it names the therapist and says she's keeping the hour for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 1212,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "Confirmations went from 61% to 84% in the first month."
    },
    {
      "start": 1240,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "And then there's the whole question of text versus email, which honestly depends on a lot of things, like your clients' age and the kind of service you run and what they're used to already."
    },
    {
      "start": 1262,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "Some of our older patients prefer a phone call."
    },
    {
      "start": 1270,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "We tried all three for a while and it depends,"
    },
    {
      "start": 1290,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Let's look at the setup."
    },
    {
      "start": 1570,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Here's the exact reminder setup, start to finish, in under two minutes."
    },
    {
      "start": 1578,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Open Settings, then Reminders, and pick the booking-time option we just talked about."
    },
    {
      "start": 1592,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Write the message in your own voice and put the staff member's name in it with the name tag."
    },
    {
      "start": 1610,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Add the deposit line so the client sees what holds their spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 1628,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Set a second reminder two hours before for anything longer than an hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 1646,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Preview it on your phone before you save, because that's where your clients read it."
    },
    {
      "start": 1660,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Turn on reply-to-confirm and you're done."
    },
    {
      "start": 1670,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Questions on that, drop them in the chat."
    },
    {
      "start": 1980,
      "speaker": "Sam (owner, Example Fitness Gym)",
      "text": "A full waitlist is worth more than a full class."
    },
    {
      "start": 1987,
      "speaker": "Sam (owner, Example Fitness Gym)",
      "text": "Classes fill once, but people cancel late all the time."
    },
    {
      "start": 1996,
      "speaker": "Sam (owner, Example Fitness Gym)",
      "text": "When someone drops out, the waitlist gets a text right away and the first yes takes the spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 2009,
      "speaker": "Sam (owner, Example Fitness Gym)",
      "text": "We fill 92% of late cancellations from the waitlist now."
    },
    {
      "start": 2020,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Ninety-two."
    },
    {
      "start": 2070,
      "speaker": "Sam (owner, Example Fitness Gym)",
      "text": "Stop letting people cancel by text message."
    },
    {
      "start": 2076,
      "speaker": "Sam (owner, Example Fitness Gym)",
      "text": "A text to the front desk sits there until someone reads it, and by then the spot is gone."
    },
    {
      "start": 2090,
      "speaker": "Sam (owner, Example Fitness Gym)",
      "text": "When they cancel in the app, the waitlist hears about it in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 2101,
      "speaker": "Sam (owner, Example Fitness Gym)",
      "text": "That one change is where most of our 92% comes from."
    },
    {
      "start": 2110,
      "speaker": "Sam (owner, Example Fitness Gym)",
      "text": "Make them cancel in the app, so the spot goes straight to the waitlist."
    },
    {
      "start": 2120,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Love it."
    },
    {
      "start": 2345,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "First question from the chat."
    },
    {
      "start": 2350,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "Do deposits scare off new clients?"
    },
    {
      "start": 2355,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "We worried about that too."
    },
    {
      "start": 2361,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "New bookings stayed flat after we added a card hold, and no-shows from first-time clients fell the most."
    },
    {
      "start": 2377,
      "speaker": "Priya (owner, Example Physio Clinic)",
      "text": "For new clients we take a card but only charge after a second no-show."
    },
    {
      "start": 2395,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Next one."
    },
    {
      "start": 2410,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "But it depends on your market, honestly."
    },
    {
      "start": 2416,
      "speaker": "Jordan (owner, Example Hair Studio)",
      "text": "In a small town everybody knows everybody, and that's the thing nobody tells you,"
    },
    {
      "start": 2440,
      "speaker": "Alex (host, Example Booking Software)",
      "text": "Great point."
    }
